{"ref":"BDB, פִּסְגָּה","hw":"פִּסְגָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פִּסְגָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.mont. Pisgah (</strong>prob. <em>cleft</em>, from a natural feature of mt.; Dr <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.17\">Dt 3:17</a><strong>)</strong>;—always <span dir=\"rtl\">הַפּ׳</span>: <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ הַפּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:20\" href=\"/Numbers.21.20\">Nu 21:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:14\" href=\"/Numbers.23.14\">23:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:27\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.27\">Dt 3:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:1\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.1\">34:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַשְׁדֹּת הַפּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.17\">3:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:19\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.19\">4:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 12:3\" href=\"/Joshua.12.3\">Jos 12:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:20\" href=\"/Joshua.13.20\">13:20</a>; mt. in Moab, on NE. shore of Dead Sea, exact loc. unknown (cf. <em>Fešḫa</em> as a cliff on NW. shore, v. Di <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:20\" href=\"/Numbers.21.20\">Nu 21:20</a>); Φασγα <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.17\">Dt 3:17</a> +, τ. λαξευτήν <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 4:49\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.4.49\">4:49</a>, Λελαξευμένου <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:20\" href=\"/Numbers.21.20\">Nu 21:20</a> +.","next":"BDB, פִּסָּה","prev":"BDB, פָּסַג"}